#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1524 (cutin)
- "ra_gman2"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1525 (mes)
- "[Dad]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1526 (mes)
- "What about our son then?"
