#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1527 (cutin)
- "ra_gwoman"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1528 (mes)
- "[High Priest]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1529 (mes)
- "A boy with the same citeria but knows nothing is useless..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1530 (cutin)
- "ra_gman2"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1531 (mes)
- "[High Priest]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1532 (mes)
- "The Pope was only one minute apart from generations. And not a single boy was selected."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1533 (cutin)
- "ra_gwoman"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1534 (mes)
- "[High Priest]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1535 (mes)
- "What does that mean? Or does Freyja want to have her words communicated through this boy?."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1536 (cutin)
- "ra_gman2"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1537 (mes)
- "[High Priest]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1538 (mes)
- "We need to study this further. The experts should be the ones determining on this issue."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1539 (cutin)
- "ra_gwoman"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1540 (mes)
- "[High Priest]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1541 (mes)
- "...We must make a decision soon."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1542 (cutin)
- "pops_sim"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1543 (mes)
- "[Pope]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1544 (mes)
- "I don't want to go. I hate it. Please! Mom...? Dad...? Adventurer...? Save me...!!"
+ ""
