- "loo_smi"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1552 (mes)
- "[Luwmin]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1553 (mes)
- "Remember the dreamland that the two of us often talked about?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1554 (cutin)
- "pops_sim"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1555 (mes)
- "[Pope]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/EddaHalfMoonInTheDaylight.txt#1556 (mes)
- "Yes, the 'Secret Garden'! I remember that."
